{"id":"vod_md_4661","vodId":"4661","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"轻音少女","name_cn":"轻音少女","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230911-1/6619764e276c2ecad2b81a04902e70c1.jpg"},"summary":"樱丘高中的新学期开始了，这不仅仅意味着有许多新的面孔将出现在校园里，同时也意味着，一场轰轰烈烈的社团招募大战即将拉开帷幕。天然呆少女平泽唯（丰崎爱生 配音）对新的校园生活有着一份憧憬但也心怀忐忑，这时一个大大咧咧的女孩田井中律（佐藤聪美 配音）出现在了她的面前。在阿律的热情邀请下，有些迟钝的小唯莫名其妙的成为了“轻音部”的吉他手。来到轻音部活动室的小唯见到了贝斯手秋山澪（日笠阳子 配音），这个有些正经但又有些害羞的黑长直让小唯心生好感。但这时小唯才发现，这个传说中的轻音部，所有的社团居然就是她们三人，而按照学校的规定，凡是不满四人的社团就要被解散。怎么办？刚刚加入社团的小唯，立刻要开始为了保证社团不被解散而开始奋斗！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画,音乐"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 07:39:11","classic":true,"classicRank":19,"franchise":"轻音少女","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/xBgvxeNt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/UbGVHkhl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/Lg3fxrlz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/8GtDqNew/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/2DtbtfBx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/BCBZjBlO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/MosuH7zQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/OLtb0hr2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/jN1AoCfH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/bY9Buz6b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/wUnhMBBJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/yGD7JtJ4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/gm2kDmgM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230909/4Rgnsp1A/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10